FFmpeg for Beanjar's media helper, as built by beanjar-vendor (ffmpeg-helper/)

These libraries are FFmpeg's release named in BUILDINFO, with the V4L2 Request API patches by
Jonas Karlman (https://github.com/Kwiboo/FFmpeg) and Beanjar's own patches applied, configured
with only the decoders, parsers and hardware decoders BUILDINFO lists. FFmpeg, and the patches,
are licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later
(COPYING.LGPLv2.1). This build is not configured with --enable-gpl and links no GPL-licensed
library, so the libraries as built here are LGPL-2.1-or-later. LICENSE.md is FFmpeg's own
summary of its licensing.

The corresponding source is ffmpeg-helper-<version>-source.tar.xz, published with each release
of these libraries, and the build scripts in beanjar-vendor's ffmpeg-helper/ and ffmpeg/
directories.
